        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TL, Contemporary Samui</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Fusion, this unique lever features a teak inlay that is a pleasant mixture of retro wood paneling and contemporary design. This is the perfect lever for those with modern decor but want to add a slight organic touch. This adds warmth to an otherwise sterile-looking design aesthetic. It is available with 3 different rose choices--all of which exemplify a chicness that is associated with contemporary decor. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion TL Samui Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Samui Contemporary Door Lever Fusion TL:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze with a Teak Inlay</li>\r\n<li>Wood:  Plantation grown teak</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Samui Straight Contemporary Lever, Fusion TL",
                "description": "Contemporary Samui Fusion TL - Made by Fusion, this unique lever features a teak inlay that is a pleasant mixture of retro wood paneling and contemporary design. This is the perfect lever for those with modern decor but want to add a slight organic touch. This adds warmth to an otherwise sterile-looking design aesthetic. It is available with 3 different rose choices--all of which exemplify a chicness that is associated with contemporary decor. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in either brushed nickel or polished chrome. ",
